    <briefdescription>
<para>Circuit breaker for GPU backend failures. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tracks persistent GPU failures and transitions to CPU-only mode when the error rate exceeds a threshold. Implements exponential backoff to allow GPU recovery without repeatedly attempting flaky operations.</para>
<para>Thread safety: all methods are thread-safe via atomic operations.</para>
<para>Specification:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Failure window: last 100 operations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Threshold: &gt; 50% failures in window</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Backoff: exponential with max 10s between retry attempts</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Reset: after 5 consecutive successes </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
